    "Leave your email address and your license will be sent directly to you. It survives switching devices or reinstalling macOS.": {
      "comment": "⚠️ 同上，与官网逐字同源。",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请留下邮箱地址，届时授权将直接发送给你，更换设备或重装系统均不会丢失。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Leave your email address and your license will be sent directly to you. It survives switching devices or reinstalling macOS."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "留下你的電子郵件地址，授權將來會直接寄給你；換機器或重新安裝macOS都不會遺失。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "メールアドレスをご登録いただくと、ライセンスを直接お送りします。デバイスを買い替えたりmacOSを再インストールしたりしても失われません。"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hinterlasse deine E-Mail-Adresse, dann wird dir die Lizenz direkt zugeschickt. Sie bleibt auch bei einem Gerätewechsel oder einer Neuinstallation von macOS erhalten."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Laissez votre adresse e-mail et votre licence vous sera envoyée directement. Elle reste valable si vous changez d’appareil ou réinstallez macOS."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "License": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "授权"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "License"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "授權"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ライセンス"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lizenz"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Licence"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Licensing opens with version 1.0. Tungsten Edge is completely free until then, and founding users who have confirmed their email will receive a permanent free license key.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "授权功能将在 1.0 正式版开放。在那之前钨极完全免费；已完成邮箱确认的原始用户，届时会收到永久免费的授权码。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Licensing opens with version 1.0. Tungsten Edge is completely free until then, and founding users who have confirmed their email will receive a permanent free license key."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "授權將於1.0版開放。在那之前Tungsten Edge完全免費；已完成電子郵件確認的創始使用者，屆時會收到永久免費的授權碼。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ライセンス機能はバージョン1.0で開始します。それまでTungsten Edgeは完全に無料で、メールアドレスの確認を済ませた創設ユーザには、永久に無料のライセンスキーをお送りします。"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Lizenzierung startet mit Version 1.0. Bis dahin ist Tungsten Edge vollständig kostenlos, und Gründungsnutzer, die ihre E-Mail-Adresse bestätigt haben, erhalten dann einen dauerhaft kostenlosen Lizenzschlüssel."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les licences arriveront avec la version 1.0. D’ici là, Tungsten Edge est entièrement gratuit, et les utilisateurs fondateurs ayant confirmé leur adresse e-mail recevront une clé de licence gratuite à vie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
