          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What should Tungsten Edge add or improve? Tell us how you'd use it.": {
      "comment": "设置窗口 · 反馈 · 功能建议的引导文字（输入框为空时叠显）",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "希望钨极增加或改进什么？说说你的使用场景。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What should Tungsten Edge add or improve? Tell us how you'd use it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "希望Tungsten Edge增加或改進什麼？說說你會怎麼用。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tungsten Edgeに追加または改善してほしいことは何ですか? どのように使いたいかも教えてください。"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Was sollte Tungsten Edge ergänzen oder verbessern? Erzähl uns, wie du es nutzen würdest."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Que faudrait-il ajouter ou améliorer dans Tungsten Edge ? Dites-nous comment vous l’utiliseriez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What went wrong? What did you do when it happened? Paste any details that might help.": {
      "comment": "设置窗口 · 反馈 · 问题反馈的引导文字（输入框为空时叠显）",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "遇到了什么问题？怎么操作会出现？方便的话贴一下当时的情况。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What went wrong? What did you do when it happened? Paste any details that might help."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "遇到了什麼問題？當時做了什麼操作？有幫助的細節都可以貼上來。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "どんな問題が起きましたか? どんな操作をしたときに起きましたか? 参考になりそうな情報があれば貼り付けてください。"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Was ist schiefgelaufen? Was hast du gerade gemacht, als es passiert ist? Füge alle Details ein, die helfen könnten."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Que s’est-il passé ? Que faisiez-vous à ce moment-là ? Ajoutez tous les détails qui pourraient aider."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write something first.": {
